  "question": {
    "text": "The resistance of each straight section is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>.&nbsp;Find the equivalent resistance (in ohms) between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/500797_phys.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 270px; height: 123px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
